{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-124-1","title":"Psalms 124:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":124,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":124,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The church blesses God for a miraculous deliverance.</p>\n<p>(Title.) A Song.It is uncertain what the particular deliverance was which is celebrated in this Psalm. Some refer it to the deliverance of Hezekiah from Sennacherib; and others to the return from the Babylonian captivity; while Dr. A. Clarke refers it to that of the Jews from the massacre intended by Haman.</p>\n<p>120:1; 121:1; 122:1; 123:1; 124:1; 125:1; 126:1; 127:1; 128:1; *titles 129:1; 130:1; 131:1; 132:1; 133:1; 134:1; *titles The Lord. 27:1; 46:7,11; 54:4; 56:9; 118:6,7; Ex 15:1; Isa 8:9,10; Ro 8:31 Heb 13:5,6 now may. 129:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-124-2","title":"Psalms 124:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":124,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":124,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>when men. 21:1,2; 3:1; 22:12,13,16; 37:32; Nu 16:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-124-3","title":"Psalms 124:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":124,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":124,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Then they. 27:2; 35:25; 56:1,2; 57:3; 74:8; 83:4; Es 3:6,12,13 swallowed. Nu 16:30-34; Pr 1:12; Jer 51:34; Jon 1:17 their wrath. 76:10; 1Sa 20:30-33; Da 3:19; Mt 2:16; Ac 9:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-124-4","title":"Psalms 124:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":124,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":124,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>the waters. 18:4; 42:7; 69:15; Isa 8:7,8; 28:2; 59:19; Jer 46:7,8; Da 9:26 Re 12:15,16; 17:1,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-124-5","title":"Psalms 124:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":124,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":124,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>the proud. 93:3,4; Job 38:11; Jer 5:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-124-6","title":"Psalms 124:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":124,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":124,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>who hath not. 17:9; 118:13; 145:5,6; Ex 15:9,10; Jud 5:30,31; 1Sa 26:20 Isa 10:14-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-124-7","title":"Psalms 124:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":124,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":124,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Our soul. 1Sa 23:26,27; 24:14,15; 25:29; 2Sa 17:2,21,22 as a bird. 25:15; 91:3; Pr 6:5; Jer 5:26; 18:22; 2Ti 2:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-124-8","title":"Psalms 124:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":124,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":124,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>115:15; 121:2; 134:3; 146:5,6; Ge 1:1; Isa 37:16-20; Jer 32:17 Ac 4:24</p>"}]}